WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:02.580
Now, the time is ripe.

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.250
When you watch Kaleido Star,

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.820
keep your room brightly lit,
sit as far from the TV as you can,

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.260
and wait for the moment of the fate.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.090
Well, well, well.
Everyone, it's time at last.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.760
The day has finally come

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.700
to attempt the legendary great maneuver
with Miss Layla.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.500
After all those nights I cried by myself.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.060
After the many times I almost gave up.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.370
But I'm fine now.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:23.640
The tears I want now are the tears of victory.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:24.940
If I want to cry, I should cry after I win.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.570
After I win! After I win!

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:35.280
<i>Dare mo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:35.280
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be someplace</i>

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.790
<i>Dokoka ni aru</i>

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.790
<i>It has to be somewhere</i>

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:45.490
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja nai</i>

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:45.490
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:59.840
<i>Saigo made yareru to ittetane</i>

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:59.840
<i>Remember how I used to say
I could make it to the end?</i>

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:06.220
<i>Kitto tsuyogatte itanda</i>

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:06.220
<i>I must have been pretending to be tough</i>

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:14.920
<i>Itsudatte muchabakka de
zutto karamawari de</i>

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:14.920
<i>Everything I did was reckless
and it never got me anywhere</i>

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:21.490
<i>Dakedo anata dake ga soba ni ita</i>

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:21.490
<i>But you alone were always beside me</i>

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:28.170
<i>Daremo sagashiteru yume wa kitto aru</i>

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:28.170
<i>The dream everyone is looking for
must be somewhere</i>

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:30.770
<i>Aruki daseru</i>

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:30.770
<i>You can start going forward</i>

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:36.310
<i>Koko kara nani kaga hajimaru</i>

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:36.310
<i>From this moment, something will start</i>

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:38.350
<i>Shinjite itai</i>

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:38.350
<i>I want to believe that</i>

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:45.850
<i>Mada minu hikari yakusoku no
basho e to tsuzuite yuku</i>

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:45.850
<i>The light I haven't seen yet
is beaming toward the promised place</i>

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:56.320
<i>Negai ga itsuka kanau made hitori ja naisa</i>

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:56.320
<i>Until your dream comes true someday,
you're not alone</i>

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.730
We're not going to die.

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.230
We'll make sure to succeed.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:11.650
The time is ripe.

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:17.690
You who were chosen by the stage,
who overcame many ordeals.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:22.090
Now indeed is the time to tell you
everything about the legendary great maneuver.

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:25.650
You must challenge the maneuver
with unshakable confidence.

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.960
The legendary great maneuver is...

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:32.000
An Amazing Comeback

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.970
An Amazing Comeback

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.970
"An Amazing Comeback"

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:37.840
An Amazing Comeback

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.440
Wha... What?

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:43.880
Maybe that spirit of the stage
is there in front of them.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:44.750
What?

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.680
I bet he is.

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.150
In order to perform
the legendary great maneuver,

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:50.640
the players must have absolute confidence.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:54.290
After they answered that they would never die,

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:57.550
they were acknowledged
by the spirit of the stage.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:02.030
Then, if they didn't say that
they would never be afraid of dying...

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.600
They would have been abandoned
by the spirit of the stage.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.640
Either we would have to
cancel tomorrow's show,

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:09.430
or they'd attempt the maneuver
recklessly, and...

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.540
So that's the legendary great maneuver.

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.840
It's amazing.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.040
It's more than I imagined.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.550
Miss Layla,

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:21.380
please make sure to rest your shoulder well
in preparation for tomorrow.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.980
I will practice a little more.

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:25.450
All right.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:26.690
Mia...

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:27.520
Yes.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.590
I have some suggestions concerning
the stage construction for tomorrow.

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:32.390
Would you mind discussing my suggestions
with the Directing Department?

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:33.560
Sure.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.060
So, it has been set in motion.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:40.470
Tomorrow, at last,
the legendary great maneuver will be revived

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.630
by Layla Hamilton and Sora Naegino.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:47.880
Good. Keep that height and rhythm.

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:49.310
According to Miss Layla's plan,

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:51.010
they're going to switch
to a trampoline after this.

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:54.380
Please wait at the gate
until your cue to appear.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.950
Anna!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.480
So all of you came.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.120
Of course.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.920
I can't stay still.

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:04.880
Is the legendary great maneuver amazing?

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:08.420
I just built the device
which Arlon told me to build.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.090
One, two... Jump!

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:12.790
Yeah!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.270
Higher, higher!

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.940
Amazing, amazing.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.320
Marion! Jonathan!

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:33.420
Sora, everyone's back!

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:34.590
What?

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:37.380
Everyone who was in
Freedom Lights is here.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:41.490
I heard that even the people
who quit Kaleido Stage came back.

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:43.570
Everyone?

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:46.900
Kaleido Stage is back the way it was!

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.200
We did it!

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.150
I've not seen you in a while.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.220
The last place we met was
at the Vancouver Festival, right?

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:02.080
Yes.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.920
Starting tomorrow, I'll be on an
extended business trip to Asia.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.490
I don't have much time.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.060
Can you make it short
and tell me what you want to say?

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:13.360
No matter what, please come to see
Layla's performance tomorrow.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:16.130
Hm? Oh, I see.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:19.900
If it's about selling
Kaleido Stage, I already know.

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:23.310
But if you want me to do
something about it,

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:25.400
unfortunately, I have to tell you
that you should give up.

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:27.900
You and I are alike.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:34.320
I tried to re-create the Kaleido Stage
my father envisioned.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:37.990
In the end, I had no clue what
he was thinking at all.

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:40.920
No, I wasn't even
trying to understand him.

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:45.630
You too, are trying to avoid
understanding Layla's thoughts.

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.930
Avoiding? Me?

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:52.200
I'm a fool who could not bring himself
to leave the nest

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.070
even after his parents had left.

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:56.430
And you...

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:00.080
You are a fool who can't acknowledge

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.700
that your daughter has already
left the protection of your wing.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:09.240
Layla is already able to fly high and strong
even without your help.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:12.480
And she wants you to see it.

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:17.020
But you've been trying not to look at that.

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.160
Father...

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:24.030
How was my performance today?

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:28.730
Your seat is already reserved.

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:31.170
Mother? Good morning.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:34.140
Yes, it's tomorrow night.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:37.240
Sorry for letting you know
at the last moment.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:41.510
Really? How is Yume?

00:06:44.990 --> 00:06:46.350
Seats are fine.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.120
I already got you reserved seats.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:51.530
How is it?

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:53.530
Has the pain abated?

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:54.660
Yes.

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:57.220
If it stays like this, I think
I'll be all right tomorrow too.

00:06:58.570 --> 00:06:59.600
It's strange.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.570
What?

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:03.940
I'm always nervous before I go onstage,

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:08.780
but I'm calm and I just can't
wait until tomorrow.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:14.950
As a doctor, I couldn't possibly
approve of you appearing on stage,

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:19.890
but as a fan, I'll do whatever
I can to help you.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:23.220
Thank you, Kate.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.830
Sora, are you working hard?

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.100
I can't believe this.

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:40.240
Using only one arm, she can do that much.

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:41.840
Oh, Rosetta!

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.480
Amazing.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.740
You're amazing, Sora!

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:51.220
Sora...

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.390
We're all set too.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.180
Okay.

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:00.560
Miss Layla...

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:13.240
Then, after that, the entire cast
will move away at once.

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:15.300
Then they will start
the legendary great maneuver.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:18.800
Your special stage is there.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:39.530
I finally understand how you felt

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.300
when you sent my father off to the stage.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.670
The players who were chosen by the stage

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:46.300
cannot help but attempt
the legendary great maneuver.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:49.170
Nobody can stop it.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:50.670
I know.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:54.180
I planned, by any means necessary,

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:57.210
to create a Kaleido Stage
that doesn't produce any injuries.

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.920
But, in the end,
I wound up losing everything.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:05.560
It's not finished yet.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.790
What will be will be.

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.530
You should run it the way you like.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:15.370
Originally, I planned to let
Arlon handle all management-related matters.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.700
No...

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:20.100
As I see it, I think Kaleido Stage
should belong to you.

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:24.770
Your reckless method made
Sora who she is now.

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:27.050
I did nothing.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:30.110
She just dashed headlong into this herself.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:34.580
So, it finally happens tomorrow.

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:37.980
Yes. It should be around this time tomorrow.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.160
The legendary great maneuver...

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:45.460
I will perfect it with Miss Layla by any means.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:53.540
The swing is longer than the one
we used for practice.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:55.080
So watch your timing.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:55.870
Yes.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:57.980
With our power,

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:00.280
we're going to turn the legend into a reality.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.770
Yes.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.280
Excuse me,

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.150
may I ask you one question?

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.190
What?

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:10.930
If Fool hadn't qualified us yesterday,

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.390
what were you going to do?

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.760
I never considered that.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.430
What? You didn't?

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:21.840
No.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:25.510
Naturally, I thought that
we would be qualified by Fool.

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:28.940
But, come to think of it, it's usually
what everyone thinks. How about you, Sora?

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:30.350
Well...

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:31.940
To tell you the truth, I'm the same.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.600
Both of them are laughing.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.430
Sora!

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:52.260
Yes.

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:53.960
You have guests.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.430
Yes.

00:10:58.940 --> 00:10:59.910
Sora.

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:01.610
Mother, Father...

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:05.140
Yume! Have you been a good girl?

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:08.350
Thank you for inviting us, Sora.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:09.550
It's not a big deal.

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:12.280
I'm the one who's supposed to thank you
for coming all the way here.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:17.130
We're just happy because if this
were the old you, you would say,

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:18.560
"l don't want to ask them
to come all the way here".

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.100
You used to be so reserved. Remember?

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:22.500
Oh, that's true.

00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:23.830
You were the girl who was concerned
about the hotel expenses

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:27.340
and picked the flight which departed
on the same day of the audition.

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:29.400
Yes, I remember that.

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:31.110
It made me worry more.

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:32.770
Well, I thought it would be all right, so...

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.950
Sora, somehow, you're so lively.

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:39.110
I think it means you're confident.

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:40.080
Yes.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:43.020
That's why I want both of you
to see my performance by all means.

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.780
Of course, you too, Yume.

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:47.640
You have two more people
you want to show. Right?

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.220
You have four parents.

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:55.590
We'll all be watching over you.

00:11:58.430 --> 00:11:59.830
Yes.

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:30.270
Really, you're so pushy.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.130
Please don't say something like that
and just watch.

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:40.540
Please reconsider selling Kaleido Stage.

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:42.970
It's already a done deal.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.550
Mr. Kenneth...

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.580
Then maybe I should buy it back.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:52.390
What? All by yourself? Ridiculous!

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.990
Those who are afraid to take risks

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:57.990
have no choice but to walk behind.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:12:59.120
You greenhorn.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.830
Please keep holding it tight, Sora.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:04.630
Yes.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.040
If we perfect the legendary great maneuver,

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:09.090
the audience will come back again.

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:10.640
Yes.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:14.630
If they do, let's create
a wonderful show again.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:19.540
A real show which both
children and adults can enjoy.

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:29.760
Oh, Kate, how are Sora and everybody doing?

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:30.790
They're fine.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:31.760
Good.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.620
The last card.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.790
The potential for unlimited possibilities.

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:33.010
The upright Fool.

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:38.690
The door to the future will open
to those fools who are not afraid.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.700
It looks like they don't have any lifelines.

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.910
Really? Then if they drop...

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.500
That would be bad...

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:57.240
I'm going to create the best show
with Miss Layla.

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.800
Sora...

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:16.920
Somehow, I'm getting chills.

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:26.540
It's so far, but it looks like it's
so close to me. It's like magic.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.580
Let's start, Sora.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:35.380
Yes.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.610
I need to focus only on Miss Layla.

00:15:39.320 --> 00:15:40.910
Come, Sora!

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:42.720
Jump toward Miss Layla...

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.700
Amazing!

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:04.450
They did it.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:06.570
They're flying. Really...

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.880
Both of you have wings on your back.

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:15.620
Is this really happening?

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:20.850
They finally made the legend reality.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.870
I'm not scared at all.

00:16:23.870 --> 00:16:26.230
I'm with Miss Layla.

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:29.200
I'm so happy.

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:31.330
I feel like crying.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:36.300
I wish I could keep performing like this forever.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:40.800
The brilliance of life
that doesn't flinch at anything.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.620
That is indeed the legendary great maneuver.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.150
Now, I know.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:50.420
Not only is the legendary great maneuver
a dangerous maneuver,

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:55.320
but it is also an expression of a strong life
that keeps even death at bay.

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.370
Arlon...

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.330
The maneuver which even gives
the audience the strength to live...

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:02.960
That's what the legendary great maneuver was.

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:05.610
Amazing.

00:17:05.610 --> 00:17:07.970
No wonder someone like me
was unable to get in their way.

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.100
Sora, let's go back.

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:11.410
Yes.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:15.050
The swing is farther than
it's supposed to be because of the wind.

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.280
Let's do it with all our might.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:17.270
Okay.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:18.850
One!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.520
Two!

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:21.420
Three!

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:45.300
It's done.

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:54.750
Hey, dim the lighting.

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:56.120
What? But...

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:57.560
No buts. Hurry.

00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:58.350
Yes.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:04.490
Miss Layla...

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:20.040
Amazing! Sora, you're the best!

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.350
Amazing. It was amazing!

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:25.980
I've never seen anything like that before.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:32.950
Sora, you did it.

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:44.500
I feel like I'm still flying.

00:18:54.750 --> 00:18:55.840
Layla...

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.990
Father...

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.580
It was a wonderful show.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:02.520
Did you see it?

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:04.390
Yes.

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:07.520
Now I understand what Yuri said.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:09.890
Yuri?

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:17.770
You can fly anywhere with your own wings
without my help anymore.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:19.240
Father...

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.040
Did you hurt your shoulder?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.180
Yes.

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:24.650
Is it bad?

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:26.250
At least,

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:29.420
I know I won't be able to
appear on Kaleido Stage anymore.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:30.510
What?

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:34.250
It's not true, is it?

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:37.220
It is true.

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:40.660
I can't believe it. But...

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:44.190
Kate already told me.

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:49.000
But still, I didn't want to miss this chance.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:53.440
I staged the best performance with you.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:56.480
And received the best applause.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:59.070
I can't ask anything more
for my last performance.

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:03.440
But... but... I...

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:05.480
Sora!

00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:53.860
Sora...

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.170
Sora, be strong.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.840
I can't do it!

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:02.040
It's impossible.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:07.000
In order to perfect the
legendary great maneuver with you,

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:10.210
I prepared myself to pay any price.

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:12.090
Sora,

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:15.450
didn't you tell me that
you would challenge fate with me?

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.490
If what you told me is really true,

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:19.890
stand up, Sora!

00:21:27.230 --> 00:21:30.440
Sora, from now on,

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.960
I want you to be my dream.

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:41.380
Please be my dream, Sora.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:47.380
I'm going to be Miss Layla's dream?

00:21:48.060 --> 00:21:49.560
That's right.

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:53.390
I know you can become a true Kaleido Star.

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:56.120
A true Kaleido Star...

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:11.140
<i>Boku wa koko ni iru
sora to michi no aida de mukai kaze</i>

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:11.140
<i>I'm here between the sky and the roads,
and facing against the wind</i>

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:26.590
<i>Soshite mae o muiteiru,
mou nido to kanashimi ga furanai youni to</i>

00:22:12.810 --> 00:22:26.590
<i>And I'm facing forward so the sorrow
doesn't rain down ever again</i>

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:32.570
<i>Ano kabe o koete kokomade kitanda</i>

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:32.570
<i>I came all the way here after
I jumped over that wall</i>

00:22:32.570 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>Nigedashitaku naru koto wa nando mo aru</i>

00:22:32.570 --> 00:22:39.770
<i>There are many times
when I just want to run away</i>

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:45.180
<i>Dakedo kokoni irunara taishite bibitte inai</i>

00:22:39.770 --> 00:22:45.180
<i>But I'm still here,
so, I'm not daunted that much</i>

00:22:45.180 --> 00:22:52.720
<i>Kakinaguri no uta "hajimekara yareba iisa"</i>

00:22:45.180 --> 00:22:52.720
<i>The poem I scribbled down, I can just
start writing over from the beginning</i>

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:58.180
<i>Umaku kakenaku te boku wa waratte iru</i>

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:58.180
<i>Unable to write it well, I'm laughing</i>

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:00.630
Sora...

00:23:00.630 --> 00:23:02.430
Sora, hurry!

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:04.230
Hey, Sora!

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:06.330
Yes!

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:11.570
Miss Layla, I will become
a true Kaleido Star no matter what!

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:13.540
I will! I will!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:15.610
Ouch!

00:23:15.610 --> 00:23:18.340
I will work harder and harder!

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:23.840
Hi, everyone! I am Sora Naegino.

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:27.050
How was the legendary great maneuver
which I did with Miss Layla?

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:31.390
It was so tough. I worked so hard.
And I cried so much.

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:35.260
But I am Miss Layla's dream,
and Miss Layla's dream is me.

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:38.930
I'll definitely become a true Kaleido Star,
for Miss Layla's sake as well!

00:23:38.930 --> 00:23:40.160
I will! I will!

00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:42.740
Next time on Kaleido Star,

00:23:42.740 --> 00:23:43.800
"Amazing Prologue To Stardom, part 1 "

00:23:43.800 --> 00:23:45.610
Next Kaleido Star
Amazing Prologue To Stardom (Part 1)

00:23:43.800 --> 00:23:45.610
"Amazing Prologue To Stardom, part 1 "

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:46.940
Next Kaleido Star
Amazing Prologue To Stardom (Part 1)

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:46.940
My wings are my dream and on towards the sky.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:48.030
My wings are my dream and on towards the sky.
